USER ## Levels at a glance
USER 
USER The requirements live in `SPEC.md` section 5; this is only orientation.
USER 
USER | Level | In one line |
USER |---|---|
USER | CL1 · process | All four moves: bar first and approved, work pinned, read independently beside a control, record kept with a named decision |
USER | CL2 · process | CL1, plus repeated runs with their spread, and model readers on a separate family and endpoint |
USER | CL3 · process | CL2, plus each reader shown failing a held-out planted case first, and a signed, logged record |
USER | baseline | The bar came after the work started: a valid description, with no level |
