USER in-toto asks a new predicate to explain why existing ones do not cover its use. Read against the
USER predicates vetted in the in-toto Attestation Framework at tag `v1.2.0` and the SLSA Verification Summary
USER specification (the draft in the SLSA repository at commit `3cd3fdd`):
